  "text": "### 2. Operational Risk  \n**Appetite:** Low  \n**Tolerance:**\n- **Annual Operational Losses:** <£50,000\n- **Major Incidents:** <1 per year\n- **System Outages:** <8 hours per year\n- **Process Errors:** <0.5% error rate  \n**Rationale:**\nFirstUK Bank prioritizes operational reliability, customer trust, and regulatory compliance. Invests in systems, training, and controls to prevent operational failures.  \n**Controls:**\n- Comprehensive SOPs and procedures\n- Staff training and competency assessment\n- System redundancy and disaster recovery\n- Automated controls where possible\n- Regular audits and monitoring  \n---",
